<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - WorldCom cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - WorldCom cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it downgraded WorldCom Inc to hold.</p>
<p>-- Said previous rating unavailable.</p>
<p>-- Said proposed merger of Excel Communications and Telco Communications Group &quot;could result in large wholesale losses for WorldCom and meaningful revenue deceleration.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Said proposed merger would expose WorldCom's &quot;vulnerability to shifts in wholesale traffic.&quot;</p>
<p>-- WorldCom lost 1-5/16 to 27-1/2.</p>
</text>
